        "lp2_video_play_aria": "Daar bandhigga badeecadda ee 90-ilbiriqsi",
        "lp2_teacher_c3_body": "Jooji akhrinta magacyada warqadda halka ardaydu sugayaan. Hal gujin ayaa soo jiidaya liiskaaga Google Classroom, diiwaangelisa kuwa soo daaha daqiiqad kasta, oo kuu soo celisa 5-ta daqiiqo ee ugu horreysa xiisad kasta.",
