        "lp2_teacher_link_guide": "Hagaha Shaqada oo Dhammaystiran ee Macallinka →",
        "lp2_teacher_link_compare": "Eeg sida Attendance Tracker uga duwan yahay Tartame →",
        "lp2_teacher_link_reviews": "Akhri dhammaan 14-ka faallo ee la xaqiijiyay ee Google Workspace Marketplace →",
        "lp2_teacher_c4_body": "Si toos ah ula midow liisaska Google Classroom ka hor fasalka, soo deji CSV-ga Canvas iyo Moodle, oo bixi shahaadooyin PDF oo la xaqiijin karo.",
        "lp2_teacher_c4_title": "Dhoofinta nidaamyada maareynta waxbarashada (LMS)",
        "lp2_teacher_c3_title": "Taariikhda xaadirinta iyo warbixinta simistarka",
        "lp2_teacher_c2_body": "Dooro Lifetime Pro oo hal mar la bixiyo ($9.99–$29, rukhsad joogto ah ma leh) ama qorshayaasha sanadlaha ah ee Macallinka ($4.99–$14.99/sanadkii), Waaxda ($59/sanadkii), iyo Machadka ($149/sanadkii).",
        "lp2_teacher_c2_title": "Qiimaha macallimiinta iyo ikhtiyaarka Lifetime-ka",
        "lp2_teacher_c1_body": "Raadraac toos ah oo aan xad lahayn gudaha Google Meet iyo 2 dhoofin oo bilaash ah bishiiba (Google Sheets, CSV, ama Excel) iyo 1 dhoofin oo dheeraad ah fasalka ka badan 25 arday.",
        "lp2_teacher_c1_title": "Ikhtiyaar bilaash ah oo loogu talagalay fasallada ilaa 25 arday",
        "lp2_teacher_sub": "Si toos ah ula soco xaadirinta, aqoonso kuwa soo daaha, una dhoofso xog habaysan Google Sheets, Excel, ama CSV. Soo rar liisaska Google Classroom adigoon gacanta ku qorin.",
