            "scopeModal.desc": "Dhoofintaadu ma dhicin sababtoo ah gelitaanka Google Drive lama siin markii aad soo gashay. Si aad u kaydiso imaanshahaaga xaashida xaashida, Google waxa ay u baahan tahay ogolaansho faylka Drive.",
            "pricing.builtDiffSub": "Kordhinta Chrome waxay xoqdaa bogga shabakadda Google Meet waxayna jebiyaan mar kasta oo Google cusboonaysiiyo koodkiisa. Tracker imaanshaha waa ku-darka goobta shaqada Google ee rasmiga ah oo lagu dhisay Google Meet SDK ee asalka ah.",
            "pricing.builtDiffTitle": "Waa maxay sababta Tracker-ka xaadirka ahi u garaaco kordhinta guud ee Chrome",
            "tip.autoExport": "Waxaad la socotaa shirar badan oo toos ah laakiin dhif iyo naadir ayaa la dhoofiyaa. Dhoofinta tooska ah ee Pro ayaa mid walba ku keydisa Google Sheets marka wicitaanku dhamaado -",
            "toast.participantsCapped": "Kulan ballaaran - oo muujinaya {n} ugu horreeya ee ka qaybgalayaasha {total}.",
            "toast.rateLimited": "Kulan ballaaran - Google ayaa si kooban u xaddidaya cusboonaysiinta imaanshaha. Liiskaagu waa badbaado; dib u tijaabin wax yar ka yar.",
            "pricing.cmp1Body": "eber DOM xoqid Wuxuu si caadi ah uga shaqeeyaa Google Meet oo dhan Chrome, Edge, Safari, Firefox, Mac, Windows, iyo Chromebooks iyada oo aan la rakibin kordhinta browserka.",
            "tip.autoExportCta": "daar auto-Dhoofinta →",
