        "lp2_reviews_read_all": "Soma maoni yote 14 yaliyothibitishwa kulingana na matokeo →",
        "lp2_reviews_sub": "Kila maoni hapa chini yamechapishwa kama yalivyo kutoka kwa watumiaji waliothibitishwa kwenye Google Workspace Marketplace. Walimu hutumia Attendance Tracker kurekodi mahudhurio na kuhamisha kwenda Google Sheets.",
