        "pricing.builtDiffEyebrow": "Anders gebou",
        "pricing.builtDiffSub": "Chrome-uitbreidings skraap Google Meet se webblad en breek wanneer Google sy kode bywerk. Attendance Tracker is 'n amptelike Google Workspace-byvoeging wat op die inheemse Google Meet SDK gebou is.",
        "pricing.builtDiffTitle": "Waarom Attendance Tracker generiese Chrome-uitbreidings klop",
